<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.5.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00438</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.5.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>50655b44-a71f-4961-acae-210a8ec4a6b9</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis> Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1-4, add the equations in the system to find a new equation.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
<item>
  \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x - 5y = -1\\ -6x - 3y = -39 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item> \(2y = -38\)</item>
  <item>\(-2y = -40\)</item>
  <item>\(-8y = -40\)</item>
  <item>\(-8x = -40\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis>\( -8y = -40 \)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
<item>
  \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 5x - 3y = -1\\ -6x + 3y = -6 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item> \(x = -7\) or \(-x = 7\)</item>
  <item>\(-x = -7\) or \(x = 7\)</item>
  <item>\(-6x = -7\) or \(6x = 7\)</item>
  <item>\(-11x = -7\) or \(11x = 7\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( -x = -7\) or \(x = 7\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
        <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x - 3y = 3\\ -4x - 10y = 62 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(-13y = 65\)</item>
  <item>\(-8x = 65\)</item>
  <item>\( -8y = 65\)</item>
  <item>\(-13x = 65\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \( -13y = 65\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x + 16y = -6\\ -6x - 10y = 6 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)</item>
  <item>\(6x = 0\) or \(x = 0\)</item>
  <item>\(12x = 0\) or \(x = 0\)</item>
  <item>\(6y = 12\) or \(y = 6\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(6y = 0\) or \(y = 0\)</para>
<para>For questions 5-10, solve each system of equations.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 6x + 27y = -12\\ -6x - 26y = 14 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((2.5,-1)\)</item>
  <item>\((-11,2)\)</item>
  <item>\((7,-1)\)</item>
  <item>\((-20,4)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x = -11, y = 2\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 3x + 4y = 8\\ -3x + 6y = 42 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((-10,2)\)</item>
  <item>\((-14,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((-4,5)\)</item>
  <item>\((0,7)\)</item>
</list>
<para>Answer: \(x = -4, y = 5\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item> \( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 5x - 9y = 68\\ -5x + 6y = -47 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((7,-2)\)</item>
  <item>\((13,3)\)</item>
  <item>\((19,3)\)</item>
  <item>\((1,-7)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>\(x = 1, y = -7\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} -3x + 5y = -57\\ 8x - 5y = 77 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((19,0)\)</item>
  <item>\((4,-9)\)</item>
  <item>\((14,-3)\)</item>
  <item>\((-1,-17)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x = 4, y = -9\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x - 2y = -28\\ -7x + 2y = 46 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((0,14)\)</item>
  <item>\((-4,6)\)</item>
  <item>\((-8,-5)\)</item>
  <item>\((-6,2)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x = -6, y = 2\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} -2x + 3y = 23\\ 2x - 6y = -56 \end{array}\right. \)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\((5,11)\)</item>
  <item>\((2,9)\)</item>
  <item>\((8,12)\)</item>
  <item>\((8,13)\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x = 5\), \(y = 11\)</para></section>
</content>
